## SOH Consolidator Suite

### 1. bkt_consolidator.py
| Field | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Version** | 3.0 |
| **Status** | ✅ Active |
| **Purpose** | Consolidates daily Booktopia PAD (Purchase Advice Data) CSV files into Booktopia_SOH.xlsx |
| **Location** | `...\SOH\Scripts\bkt_consolidator.py` |
| **Launcher** | `run_bkt.vbs` |
| **Input** | `YYYYMMDD_BKT.csv` — pipe or comma delimited, from Stage\ folder |
| **Output** | `Booktopia_SOH.xlsx` — one column per day, latest in col B |
| **SOH Column** | `stock_on_hand` |
| **Cleanup** | Deletes all `YYYYMMDD_BKT.csv` and `.xlsx` from Stage |
| **Dependencies** | pandas, openpyxl |
| **JSON State** | `bkt_consolidator_state.json` |
| **Created** | 29-Jul-2026 |
| **Last Updated** | 29-Jul-2026 |

**Notes:**
- Auto-detects delimiter (pipe or comma) on each file
- Strips column name whitespace to handle format variations
- Date extracted from filename (not CSV content) for reliability
- Overwrites existing date column if same date re-processed

