### 4. nielsen_consolidator.py
| Field | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Version** | 3.0 |
| **Status** | ✅ Active |
| **Purpose** | Consolidates Nielsen ABM Pd Chart data into Master_Neilson.xlsx |
| **Location** | `...\Nielsen\Scripts\nielsen_consolidator.py` |
| **Launcher** | `run_nielsen.vbs` |
| **Input** | `ABM Pd Chart*.xlsx` — Medicine and Others categories (from Elna Schonfeldt monthly) |
| **Output** | `Master_Neilson.xlsx` — ISBN + 6 year columns (2021–2026) |
| **Volume Column** | `YTD Volume` (2026, 2024) or `Volume` (2025, 2023–2021) |
| **Cleanup** | Deletes all `ABM Pd Chart*.xlsx` from Stage |
| **Dependencies** | pandas, openpyxl |
| **JSON State** | `nielsen_consolidator_state.json` |
| **Created** | 29-Jul-2026 |
| **Last Updated** | 29-Jul-2026 |

**Notes:**
- Fresh build: reads all 6 year sheets → fully populated master from scratch
- Amend mode: reads current year only → updates current year column only
- Handles different header rows per year sheet (row 1 for 2024–2026, row 4 for 2021–2023)
- Duplicate ISBNs across Medicine + Others files → keeps higher value
- Metadata (data_as_on, updated_on) stored in JSON only — not in Excel
- Master format: ISBN | 2026 | 2025 | 2024 | 2023 | 2022 | 2021 (no Type column)

